{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:53:58+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-13T16:53:58+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Dunelm Group plc","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Specialty Retail","country":"United Kingdom","city":"Syston","website":"https://www.dunelm.com","employees":11567,"summary":"Dunelm Group plc, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the retail of homewares in the United Kingdom and Ireland. The company offers furniture and beds products, such as bedroom, living room, dining room, and other furniture, as well as sofas and armchairs; and bedding products comprising bed linen, duvets, pillows, protectors, dorma, and baby and kids bedding products. It also provides home decors, including wall art and decor, flowers and plants, ornaments, vases, mirrors, photo and picture frames, decorative trays and bowls, candles and home fragrance, clocks, fireplace accessories, curtains, rugs, cushions, throws, bean bags, housewarming gifts, engagement and wedding gifts, anniversary gifts, personalized gifts, and gift cards. In addition, the company offers roller, roman, venetian, vertical, shutters, Perfect Fit, cordless, kitchen, bathroom, children, and door blinds; ceiling lights, table and bedside lamps, lamp shades, floor lamps, wall lights, rechargeable lighting, bathroom lighting, string lights, outdoor lighting, LED lighting, chandeliers, lamp bases, and tripod lights; and light bulbs, pendant flex cables, electrical and wiring accessories, and light switches. Further, it provides christmas and autumn products; cooking, dining, electricals, utilities, and pet products; bath products; decorating and DIY products; storage products; and kids products. Additionally, the company offers specialist services, such as made-to-measure curtains and Pausa cafes. The company sells its products through stores and online store. The company was founded in 